    "title": "Washington Huddle Overtime: RFK is home once again - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Derek Forrest ,\n24 minutes ago\nWASHINGTON (DC News Now) — On this week’s episode of Washington Huddle: Overtime , Sports Director Derek Forrest is joined by Washington legend Santana Moss to break down the latest with the Burgundy and Gold.\nThe two dive into the big news around the RFK site becoming the home of the Washington Commanders once again. They also recap Washington’s 27–18 loss to the Green Bay Packers and preview this weekend’s matchup with the Las Vegas Raiders.\nWashington Huddle Overtime: Commanders looking for 2-0 start The Commanders host the Raiders Sunday afternoon at 1 p.m. at Northwest Stadium.\nCatch Washington Huddle Friday nights at 7:30 p.m. on DCW50, and again Saturday nights at 11 p.m. on DC News Now.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to DC News Now | DC, Virginia, Maryland News, Weather, Traffic, Sports Live.",
